<p>Anthropic推出Claude Opus 5.5，性能登顶多项权威评测，调用成本大降40%，新增自适应思考与百万token上下文。这波升级将冲击套壳AI初创与中端模型，推动开发者竞争力转型。<a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNTA3MDY1NA==&amp;chksm=8d749e736904790f449a6f9c42966a1a76c16936caf55d377b41de4dabf050f11575fc1cb1cf&amp;idx=1&amp;mid=2455896057&amp;sn=93ff2184c46f0170e56cbbbfdcd351ca#rd" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">&gt;阅读原文</a></p>
